{"results":[{"url":"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/nigeria-population/","final_url":"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/nigeria-population/","title":"Nigeria Population (2026) - Worldometer","description":"Population of Nigeria: current, historical, and projected population, growth rate, immigration, median age, total fertility rate (TFR), population density, urbanization, urban population, country's share of world population, and global rank. Data tables, maps, charts, and live population clock","language":"en","text":"# Nigeria Population (LIVE)\n\nretrieving data...\n\nNigeria Population (1950 - 2026)\n\n  \n\nYearly Population Growth Rate (%)\n\n* The current population of Nigeria is  243,933,225  as of Wednesday, November 4, 2026, based on Worldometer's elaboration of the latest United Nations data1.\n* Nigeria 2026 population is estimated at  242,431,832  people at mid-year.\n* Nigeria population is equivalent to  2.9%  of the  total world population .\n* Nigeria ranks number  6  in the list of  countries and other entities by population .\n* The population density in Nigeria is 266 per km² (689 people per mi²).\n* The total land area is 910,768 km² (351,649 sq. miles).\n* 64.6% of the population is  urban  (156,548,433 people in 2026)\n* The median age in Nigeria is  18.3 years .\n\n 1. U.N. Dept. of Economic and Social Affairs - Population Division. World Population Prospects: The 2024 Revision. (Medium-fertility variant).\n\n## Population of Nigeria (2026 and historical)\n\n| Year | Population | Yearly % Change | Yearly Change | Migrants (net) | Median Age | Fertility Rate | Density (P/km²) | Urban Pop % | Urban Population | Country's Share of World Pop | World Population | Nigeria Global Rank |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026 | 242,431,832 | +2.06% | 4,904,050 | −2,810 | 18.3 | 4.20 | 266 | 64.6% | 156,548,433 | 2.9% | 8,300,678,396 | 6 |\n| 2025 | 237,527,782 | +2.08% | 4